{
  "finding": "The initial evaluator required each invalid checkbox to repeat aria-describedby. Claude describes the shared collection error on its fieldset; Chrome exposes that group name and error description in the accessibility tree. This is a semantic group association, not a missing message.",
  "correction": "Accept direct error association for individual fields, or a described semantic fieldset with a legend for radio/checkbox groups. Error summary, invalid state, meaningful associated message and recovery requirements remain.",
  "sources": [
